ntpasted0\"><span style=\"font-family: SolaimanLipi;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></pre>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 137.812px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 32.25pt;\">\r\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"line-height: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span class=\"contentpasted0\"><span style=\"font-family: SolaimanLipi;\"><br />ডেপুটি ফোকাল পয়েন্ট&nbsp;</span></span></span></pre>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>', NULL, 2, '2', NULL, 'citizen_charter.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-04-27 09:56:43'),
(4, 'WHAT WE DO', 'what-we-do', '<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; line-height: 24pt;\"><strong>Areas of Investment</strong></span></span></pre>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Infrastructure</span></pre>\r\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Power and Energy</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Connectivity &amp; Communication </span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Industrial Infrastructure Projects including Economic Zones</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Tourism Infrastructure</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Natural Resource, Environmental &amp; Social Infrastructure </span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Urban &amp; Rural Development Projects</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">IT and IT Infrastructure Projects </span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Energy Efficiency</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Renewable Energy</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Waste Management</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Food &amp; Agricultural Processing and Value Chain</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<pre><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 14pt;\">Women Entrepreneurship</span></pre>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<pre><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><strong>Products &amp; Services</strong></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><strong>Products</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\">Considering the varying needs of the projects, BIFFL extends finances through different 13 loans and&nbsp;equity products.<br /></span></pre>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; width: 1692px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 418px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 25px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Debt Financing</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.859px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 25px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Equity Investment</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1147.14px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 25px;\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 284.062px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 418px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 284.062px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Term Loan</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Working Capital Loan</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Bridge Financing</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Factoring</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Take over Financing</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Take out Financing</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Lease Financing</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Bond Financing</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Commercial Papers/ Instruments</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 263.859px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 284.062px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Ordinary Share</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Preference Share</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Mezzanine Financing</span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif;\">Convertible Debt</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1147.14px; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 284.062px;\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24pt;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"width: 904px;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 904px;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 8pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br /><strong>Services</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 904px;\">\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; width: 894.5px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 878.5px; padding: 0in 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; line-height: 18pt;\">Reviewing preliminary business plan/concept note prepared by project sponsors</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"line-height: 18pt;\">Conducting market research for the project</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18pt;\">Drawing a full-fledged, sound business plan</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18pt;\">Devising an optimal financial structure/package</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18pt;\">Liaising and advising for necessary authority permissions</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 2, '2', NULL, 'what_we_do_services.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-10 04:53:25');
INSERT INTO `custom_page` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `description`, `document`, `category`, `slider`, `serial_number`, `add_info1`, `add_info2`, `add_info3`, `status`, `created_at`) VALUES
(6, 'Financial Literacy', 'financial-literacy', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 class=\"w-blogpost-title\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 22px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: #ffffff; font: 30px / 40px Habibi; text-transform: uppercase; color: #444444; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">FINANCIAL LITERACY DAY 2023</h1>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://biffl.org.bd/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Picture1-1024x658.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; font-size: 16px;\">Bangladesh Infrastructure Finance Fund Limited (BIFFL) celebrated &ldquo;Financial Literacy Day 2023&rdquo; at its corporate office on 6</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px; line-height: 0; position: relative; top: -0.5em; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\';\">th</span><span style=\"color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;March 2023 by exchanging views with its clients.&nbsp; The Chief Executive Officer, Chief Operating Officer, and other executives/officials of the organization were present on the occasion. Clients from different segments, like small entrepreneurs, women, working adults, etc. attended the program to get valuable insights.</span></p>', NULL, 2, '2', NULL, 'finanical-literacy.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-16 04:08:58'),
(8, 'Project Gallery', 'project-gallery', '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">Infrastructure</span><br /></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Dhaka Bypass Expressway Development Company Limited (DBEDC)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Dhaka Bypass Project has been identified as one of the strategically important infrastructures necessary to support such economic growth which will connect different parts of the country more efficiently. The Dhaka Bypass Road is a strategic corridor for freight movement linking the manufacturing center to the north of Dhaka with the center of shipping activity at the port of Chittagong in the south. A two-stage bidding was conducted by RHD in 2017 for implementing the upgradation of existing 02 lane road into 4 Lanes through PPP (the &ldquo;Project&rdquo; or &ldquo;Dhaka By-pass Project&rdquo;), where the Consortium of 1.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -2.3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/DBEDC.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1427\" height=\"602\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Project area involves approximately 48 km of road, which connects national highways N4 (in the north) to the N1 (in the south), traversing the N2 and N3, numerous regional highways and zila (district) roads. The road will provide for a major arterial connection between the industrial zones north and northeast of Dhaka with the port connection to Chittagong in the south.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Anlima Energy Limited</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Anlima Energy Limited (AEL), a sister concern of Anlima Group. It is an Independent Power Project (IPP) project for the development of an HFO-fired power plant of 116 MW capacity at Patiya in Chittagong, just beside Karnafuly river.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/Anlima Energy Limited.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1430\" height=\"612\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Karnafuly Dry Dock Limited (KDDL)</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Karnafuly Dry Dock Limited (KDDL), is planning to establish a Dry Dock under the administrative limit of the Chittagong Port Authority (CPA) at the bank of river Karnafuly to facilitate the repair and construction of ships. This project will be the first of its kind in the private sector of Bangladesh. It is comprised of 8 (Eight) acres of land with 2 (two) slipways each of 560 feet length and a fully equipped marine workshop. It has marketing offices in Singapore and United States with drawing-design features dealt by G B Marine (Singapore) Limited.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/KDDL.jpg\" width=\"1430\" height=\"525\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">JMI Industrial Gas Limited</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\">JMI Industrial Gas Limited is a concern of JMI Group. It is located at Sitakunda, Chattagram with one satellite plant at Gazaria, Munshiganj. Production capacity is 144,000 MT per year. JMI Ind. Gas will import machineries for LPG main terminal from Durulsan, Turkey. Its businesses are production and installation of LPG cylinder filling plants machinery and equipment.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: black;\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/JMI Industrial Gas Limited.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1430\" height=\"525\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Energy Efficiency<br /></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">M.M. Ispahani Limited</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pahartali Textile &amp; Hosiery Mills (PTHM) of M. M. Ispahani Limited is one of the pioneer spinning mills in Bangladesh. PTHM comprised of five different units producing different qualities of Yarn. The plant is located at North Pahartali, Akborshah, Chattogram. BIFFL financed M.M Ispahani Limited under Energy Efficiency and Conservation Promotion Financing Project (EECPFP) of JICA and Energy Efficiency, Renewable Energy and Women Entrepreneurship Financing Project (EEREWEF) of AFD.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/M.M. Ispahani Limited.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1428\" height=\"603\" />&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/M.M. Ispahani Limited 2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1428\" height=\"1004\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Odyssey Craft (Pvt.) Limited</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Odyssey Craft (Pvt.) Limited is a 100% export oriented Grren Ready Made Garment project. The factory is located at at Depashai, Sombag, Kalampur, Dhamrai, Dhaka. This site is approximately 6 kilometers from Dhamrai Bus Station and Bazaar and is connected via Dhamrai-Kamalpur Road. The Product mix comprises Non-Denim, Denim and Jackets. The project has been financed under the Syndication Arrangement among BIFFL, Agrani Bank Limited, NRB Bank Limited and First Finance Limited. BIFFL, the Arranger of the Syndication, financed the Project under Energy Efficiency and Conservation Promotion Financing Project (EECPFP) of JICA and its own fund as well.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/Odyssey Craft.jpg\" width=\"1428\" height=\"1071\" /></span></p>\r\n<h1 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\">Renewable Energy<br /></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">Technaf Solartech Energy Limited</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technaf Solartech Energy Limited is&nbsp;a Grid tied Solar Park of 20.00 MW capacity as an Independent Power Producer (lPP) located at Alikhali, South Nhila, Teknaf, Cox&rsquo;s Bazar beside Arakan Road on Build-Own-Operate (BOO) basis under PPA with BPDB for a period of 20 years.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/Technaf Solartech Energy Limited.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1428\" height=\"603\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/TechnafSolartech.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1428\" height=\"683\" /></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">M.M. Ispahani Limited (Roof top Solar Project)</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The increasing price of electricity is hitting the operating cost of business. Besides, the rising cost of fossil fuel, the source of electricity generation, has been a major threat in this era. Fossil fuel is also increasing the cost to the environment by producing greenhouse gases (GHG). Considering these, M.M. Ispahani Limited set up a 1.32 MW Rooftop Solar project over the roof of Pahartali Textile &amp; Hosiery Mills (PTHM). BIFFL financed the roof top project under Energy Efficiency, Renewable Energy and Women Entrepreneurship Financing Project (EEREWEF) of AFD. The Solar plant will support existing electricity demand and reduce burden on fuel-based power and decrease the carbon footprint.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/M.M. Ispahani Limited (Roof top Solar Project).jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1429\" height=\"881\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">Waste Management</span><br /></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Raw Tech Limited</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"msoIns\">Raw Tech Limited is a waste management and recycling plant located at Kasoghor, Valuka, Mymensingh which is adjacent to the Dhaka Mymensingh highway. The plant manufactures Polyester Staple Fibers from recycled PET bottles. The project received financing from Bangladesh Bank under the Investment Promotion and Financing Facility II (IPFF II) Project of the World Bank.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"msoIns\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/Raw Tech Limited.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1433\" height=\"1074\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"msoIns\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/Raw Tech Limited 2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1430\" height=\"1071\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"msoIns\"><img src=\"../../uploads/images/gallery/Raw Tech Limited 3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1430\" height=\"1072\" /></span></p>', NULL, 3, '2', NULL, 'about.jpg', NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-18 06:08:28');
