(4, 'Management Trainee Officer (MTO)', NULL, 'career MTO - Ad Design  Out Put 12-10-2022.pdf', '2022-10-13', '2023-06-30', 2, '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">A Unique Career Opportunity</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">BIFFL- owned by the Government of Bangladesh, represented by the Finance Division, Ministry of Finance, and a leading Non-Bank Financial Institution in Bangladesh- is looking for competent and promising talents, dedicated to engineer the growth of the country by being a part of its dynamic management team.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Position: Management Trainee Officer (MTO)</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Vacancy:&nbsp;</strong>Two (02)</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Job Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">To conduct technical due diligence as part of the due diligence process of projects;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">To manage and supervise the technical components of projects;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">To prepare and monitor the implementation of technical compliance documents required for project approval and implementation;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">To work with the credit team of BIFFL, if needed, for any infrastructure project to conduct technical due diligence and monitoring during project planning and implementation;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">To liaise with the external Technical Adviser, if any, for the projects; and</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">To carry out any other duties and responsibilities as and when assigned by the management.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Employment Status</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Full-time</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Educational Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Post-graduate/Graduate in Civil Engineering/Electrical and Electronic Engineering from reputed public/private university;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Minimum CGPA 3.30 out of 4.00</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Additional Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Age at most 30 years</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Excellent ability in speaking and writing in English and Bengali;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Capable of multi-tasking with strong presentation skills;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Excellent proficiency in computer literacy and communication.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Salary Package</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Tk.60,000.00 (Gross) per month plus other fringe benefits.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">Selection Process</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Screening and short-listing of candidates who meet qualifying requirements</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Candidate to appear in competitive written test</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Interview</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Final selection and offer</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\">Interested candidates who meet the above criteria are requested to apply through&nbsp;<a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; transition: all 0.3s ease 0s; color: #31c5c7;\" href=\"http://www.bdjobs.com/biffl\">www.bdjobs.com/biffl</a>&nbsp;by 25 October, 2022.</p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 26px 30px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; font-size: 16px;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 6px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: top; background: transparent;\">Selection will be based purely on merit.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 6px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: top; background: transparent;\">BIFFL is an equal opportunity employer and strictly maintains non-smoking environment.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 6px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: top; background: transparent;\">Any kind of persuasion will automatically disqualify candidature.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 6px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: top; background: transparent;\">BIFFL reserves the right to accept or reject any application without assigning any reason.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 6px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: top; background: transparent;\">Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted for the next phase of the selection process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: \'PT Sans\'; color: #444444; margin: 0px 0px 10px !important 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\">&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'mto-technical-2022', 'https://www.bdjobs.com/', NULL, NULL),
